tes", "label": "Clientes (CRUD)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Duplicidade \u00e9 regra de neg\u00f3cio: dois clientes podem ter o mesmo nome e/ou telefone; a identidade \u00e9 o UUID."}, {"id": "readme_historico_cobrancas", "label": "Hist\u00f3rico de Cobran\u00e7as", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_configuracoes", "label": "Configura\u00e7\u00f5es", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chaves do gateway e do WhatsApp criptografadas com AES-256-GCM em repouso; URL + segredo do webhook com rota\u00e7\u00e3o."}, {"id": "readme_motor_diario_cron", "label": "Motor di\u00e1rio (CRON)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Idempotente: materializa pr\u00f3ximos ciclos das s\u00e9ries (com catch-up), marca atrasadas, gera Pix din\u00e2mico e envia cobran\u00e7a. Falha de gateway n\u00e3o dispara mensagem sem Pix; falha de envio fica auditada em notification_logs e \u00e9 reenviada no ciclo seguinte."}, {"id": "readme_webhook_publico", "label": "Webhook p\u00fablico POST /webhooks/payments/:userId", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exige token secreto comparado em tempo constante; idempotente (replay responde alreadyPaid); responde 200 para eventos n\u00e3o mapeados para evitar tempestade de retries e n\u00e3o revelar nada sobre a base."}, {"id": "readme_notification_logs", "label": "notification_logs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_sql_puro_pg_decision", "label": "SQL puro (pg) em vez de Prisma", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Schema pequeno e consultas do dashboard (agrega\u00e7\u00f5es com FILTER, DISTINCT ON, generate_series) ficam melhores em SQL nativo; zero passo de codegen; download de bin\u00e1rios do Prisma n\u00e3o \u00e9 permitido no ambiente de empacotamento do projeto."}, {"id": "readme_dinheiro_centavos_decision", "label": "Dinheiro em centavos INTEGER", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aritm\u00e9tica exata; formata\u00e7\u00e3o BRL s\u00f3 na borda."}, {"id": "readme_date_string_decision", "label": "DATE como string YYYY-MM-DD", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Parser do pg configurado; vencimento \u00e9 conceito de calend\u00e1rio; evita bugs de fuso em meia-noite UTC."}, {"id": "readme_recorrencia_series_decision", "label": "Recorr\u00eancia com series_id + anchor_day + UNIQUE(series_id, due_date) + next_generated", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dia 31 sobrevive a fevereiro e volta ao 31; motor pode rodar N vezes ou dias atrasado sem duplicar nem furar ciclo, garantido pelo pr\u00f3prio banco."}, {"id": "readme_node_cron_sem_fila_decision", "label": "node-cron em processo, sem fila", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Um job di\u00e1rio leve n\u00e3o justifica Redis/BullMQ no MVP; a interface AppDeps j\u00e1 isola o I/O externo, ent\u00e3o promover o envio para uma fila depois n\u00e3o toca a regra de neg\u00f3cio."}, {"id": "readme_webhook_200_decision", "label": "Webhook responde 200 para eventos n\u00e3o mapeados", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Evita tempestade de retries do gateway e n\u00e3o revela nada sobre a base; seguran\u00e7a fica no token, n\u00e3o na obscuridade."}, {"id": "readme_app_deps_interface", "label": "AppDeps (interface de portas de I/O externo)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_testes_integracao", "label": "36 testes de integra\u00e7\u00e3o (6 su\u00edtes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_seguranca", "label": "Seguran\u00e7a", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_backend_dir", "label": "backend/", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_frontend_dir", "label": "frontend/", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_billing_engine", "label": "services/billing-engine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "capt